SECTION 2: COMMERCIAL & OPERATIONAL USAGE (EXCLUSIVE TO 3DMETA-SHOP)
================================================================================
Any commercial use, operational deployment within MetaRang environments, or
monetized utilization of any 3D model, texture, animation, avatar, vehicle, or
binary asset requires an official Commercial License purchased EXCLUSIVELY via:
