  - Frontend (Next.js):  https://github.com/iranpsc/3DMeta-Shop-Object-3D-Frontend

Proof of valid Commercial License is verified solely by:
  1) Active purchase record in the 3D Meta Marketplace database, AND
  2) Official registration of the buyer's MetaRang Citizen ID in the `owners.json`
     file located within the corresponding asset directory.

